⸻

Intelligent Chunking

Never embed an entire 300-page document as one block.

Instead:

BRD
Chapter 1
Business Objectives
↓
Chunk
Business Objectives
Page 5
Business Rules
↓
Chunk
Business Rule 1
↓
Chunk
Business Rule 2
↓
Chunk
Acceptance Criteria

Recommended chunk size:

* 500–1,000 tokens
* 15–20% overlap

This improves retrieval accuracy.

⸻

Metadata

Every chunk should carry rich metadata.

{
  "workspace": "Payments",
  "document": "BRD.docx",
  "section": "Business Rules",
  "page": 22,
  "feature": "Payment Recall",
  "story": null,
  "owner": "Business Analyst",
  "tags": [
    "Payments",
    "SWIFT",
    "High Value"
  ]
}

Metadata lets you retrieve only the relevant chunks.

